<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_3756890c1e5fc6e4f303d0d69c5e6674192365d99b5559676ac7dc7c72e24ed8_n0020/na_0012> <http://digistrucmed.org/notes> "Repeated exposure is identified as essential because one session is insufficient." .
